    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cassĭŏpē</span></b> ,
		ēs (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cassĭŏpēa</span></b> ,
		ae, <i><span class="en">Manil. 1, 354</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cassĭĕpēa</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cassĭĕ-peia</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 2,
